    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "0849b58ed5b3533fb51a": "My wisdom is yours, as is my knowledge. What can I do for you, $n?",
        "2ba9e3309df451f818d0": "If you desire, in addition to training, I have it within my power to erase the knowledge of your talents from your mind.  Be warned that every time you undergo this procedure the more difficult it is to perform, and therefore the more expensive it becomes.",
        "53c33f24e66250bbd7ce": "I seek more training in the priestly ways.",
        "cd91e7e938d4f3f8a69a": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "cf71adfbe5c86d1031c9": "Elune be with you, $c."
      },
      "name": "Lariia",
      "subName": "Priest Trainer",
      "translationMetadata": {
        "fields": {
          "dialogue.0849b58ed5b3533fb51a": {
